---
--- Board key :
---   0 : reset game
---
--- Keyboard players inputs :
---
---   F1 : Add coin
---   F2 : Start 1 player
---   F3 : Start 2 players
-
---   F7 : Service mode
---   F8 : 15kHz interlaced / 31 kHz progressive
-
---   SPACE  : punch
-
---   RIGHT arrow : move right
---   LEFT  arrow : move left
---   UP    arrow : up stairs
---   DOWN  arrow : down stairs
---
--- Other details : see popeye.vhd
